@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Proposed native boundary (draft, not implemented)

package "Execution host" {
  [Rust core\n(evaluation, commit)] as Core
  [Host\n(bindings, scheduling, policy)] as Host
}
package "Driver (device-specific)" {
  [Endpoint I/O and\ninterpretation] as Drv
}
node "Device / board\n(physical I/O, failure policy)" as Dev

Host --> Core : ordered input records
Core --> Host : safe/effective intent
Host --> Drv : gfdrv_api_v1\n(describe, open, poll,\napply, cancel, close)
Drv ..> Host : gfdrv_host_v1\n(clock, report)
Drv --> Dev : endpoint communication
note bottom of Core
  Not this ABI: Rust ScanDriver (core scan adapter)
  and the gf_* / gf_frame_* WASM host-core ABI
end note
@enduml
